<title>BELGIUM: Belgian tax receipts up 4.0% in 10 mths to end-Oct.</title>
<headline>Belgian tax receipts up 4.0% in 10 mths to end-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up 3.8 percent in October from the same month in 1995 and up 4.0 percent in the first ten months of 1996 from the same 1995 period, the Finance Ministery said in a statement on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Oct 96	 Oct 95     pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  225,353	217,040     +3.8</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    131,523	134,419     -2.2</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes   55,911	 56,032     -0.2</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Oct 96   Jan-Oct 95 pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  1,867,504    1,795,536   +4.0</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    1,089,077    1,060,853   +2.7</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes    485,147	469,565   +3.3</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
